WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:04,830
Prince, what's going on?

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:08,370
But if you catch a cold, you can come in.

3
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:11,650
How's the check going?

4
00:00:12,290 --> 00:00:14,800
The Song family is indeed a merchant, but

5
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,760
Not like an ordinary merchant

6
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,180
The land in Tianshui Lane is at a premium.

7
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,780
The Song family moved here three years ago

8
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,620
Not only did I buy a two-entry house,

9
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,220
Even the inner room behind their house

10
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,100
It was also secretly bought by the Song family three years ago.

11
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:29,130
Why is the Song family so rich?

12
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,170
But don’t know what to say

13
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,280
It turned out that he was deliberately trying to get rich.

14
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,800
Afraid of being exposed to wind

15
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:43,030
I really want my capital to find out why they raised their family three years ago.

16
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:45,460
Fleeing from Shengzhou to Chang'an

17
00:00:47,710 --> 00:00:50,780
The medicine of Qinggu Powder is almost used up. I need to make some more.
